[Info]
Name	Heroes at the Gate
Description	No rival keeper here, only the surface folk, and they keep coming. Hold your temple and put every last hero in the ground. Skirmish. A hero company holds a walled keep in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

